g\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c0/8k3gvzb945i77mthmb2bv0bitp018s8.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E8%90%BD%E5%AD%90%E6%97%A0%E5%A3%B0.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c0/8k3gvzb945i77mthmb2bv0bitp018s8.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />落子无声\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">5%</font>。<br />✦执行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"待机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">待机</font></span></span>]时，若未曾使用任意技能，则获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"筹谋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">筹谋</font></span></span>]。<br />✦行动结束时，若自身拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"筹谋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">筹谋</font></span></span>]，则消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层，并补充[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">庇护徽记</font></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"柯瓦雷的收藏品\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">柯瓦雷的收藏品</font></span></span>]和[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">柯瓦雷的馈赠</font></span>]已使用次数，本效果每场战斗最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">10%</font>。<br />✦执行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"待机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">待机</font></span></span>]时，若未曾使用任意技能，则所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]冷却回合减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>，并获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"筹谋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">筹谋</font></span></span>]。<br />✦行动结束时，若自身拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"筹谋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">筹谋</font></span></span>]，则消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层，并补充[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">庇护徽记</font></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"柯瓦雷的收藏品\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">柯瓦雷的收藏品</font></span></span>]和[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">柯瓦雷的馈赠</font></span>]已使用次数，本效果每场战斗最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">15%</font>。<br />✦执行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"待机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">待机</font></span></span>]时，若未曾使用任意技能，则所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]冷却回合减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>，并获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"筹谋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">筹谋</font></span></span>]。<br />✦行动结束时，若自身拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"筹谋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">筹谋</font></span></span>]，则消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层，并补充[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">庇护徽记</font></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"柯瓦雷的收藏品\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">柯瓦雷的收藏品</font></span></span>]和[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">柯瓦雷的馈赠</font></span>]已使用次数，本效果每场战斗最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<t